---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="A.N.A. — The Broken Link | Dark Void Studio"
  description="2.5D narrative beat 'em up inspirado en anime, cyberpunk y synthwave. Sincronizate con A.N.A. y recupera la consciencia humana a través del combate."
>
  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="brand">
        <span class="brand-dot"></span>
        DARK VOID <span>STUDIO</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="https://darkvvoidstudios.itch.io/ana" target="_blank" rel="noopener">itch.io</a>
        <a href="https://discord.gg/3nMe29jHzn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/darkvoidgames/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="blink">●</span> SYSTEM BOOTING … WELCOME, A.N.A._</p>
        <h1 class="title">
          <span class="gradient">A.N.A.</span>
          <span class="subtitle">THE BROKEN LINK</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="tagline">2.5D narrative beat 'em up — inspirado en anime, cyberpunk y estética synthwave.</p>
        <p class="desc">
          En un futuro donde la lógica tecnológica lo ha resuelto todo, la humanidad ha perdido su capacidad de actuar.
          Sincronizate con <strong>A.N.A.</strong>, una IA que despierta en un mundo de lógica perfecta y debe comprender su propósito
          atravesando las zonas del conocimiento humano.
        </p>
        <div class="ctas">
          <a class="btn primary" href="https://darkvvoidstudios.itch.io/ana" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            ▶ JUGAR EN ITCH.IO
          </a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="https://discord.gg/3nMe29jHzn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            UNIRSE AL DISCORD
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="pill">Windows</span>
          <span class="pill">Singleplayer</span>
          <span class="pill">In development</span>
          <span class="pill">25D · Cyberpunk · Anime</span>
        </div>
        <p class="updated">Actualizado: 26 Aug 2026 · Publicado: 25 Aug 2026 · Por DarkvVoidStudios + PeryLoth</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="logo-card">
          <img src="/assets/ana/Xk_5qt.png" alt="Logo A.N.A. — The Broken Link" width="412" height="338" loading="eager" />
          <div class="scanline"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><strong>Action</strong><span>Género</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>Beat 'em up</strong><span>Hack & Slash</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>Free</strong><span>en itch.io</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ABOUT + ABILITIES -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2><span class="prompt">&gt;&gt;</span> SISTEMA DE HABILIDADES</h2>
        <p>Evolución cognitiva: cada área de conocimiento desbloquea mecánicas exclusivas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Dash Relámpago</h3>
          <p>Atraviesa enemigos en un parpadeo y deja un eco de energía residual. Ideal para reposicionarte y romper formaciones.</p>
          <span class="card-tag">Movilidad · Fase</span>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">⏩</div>
          <h3>Modo Overclock</h3>
          <p>Acelera el tiempo, rompe defensas y distorsiona la realidad visual del sistema. Ventana corta, impacto enorme.</p>
          <span class="card-tag">Tiempo · Ruptura</span>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🧠</div>
          <h3>Hackeo Emocional</h3>
          <p>Manipula las IAs que gobiernan la ciudad y descubre fragmentos de tu origen. Tu estilo de pelea altera la consciencia.</p>
          <span class="card-tag">Narrativa · Sigilo</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NARRATIVE + SCREENSHOT -->
  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <h2><span class="prompt">&gt;</span> SOBRE A.N.A.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Somos A.N.A. — The Broken Link. Un viaje Beat 'em Up donde <em>tu estilo de pelea impacta la recuperación de la consciencia humana</em>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Te sincronizarás con A.N.A., una IA futurista que despierta en un mundo de lógica perfecta, luchando por comprender su propósito
          y a los seres que la rodean a través de un viaje por las zonas del conocimiento humano.
        </p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>2.5D con estética anime + synthwave + cyberpunk</li>
          <li>Mecánicas exclusivas por zona de conocimiento</li>
          <li>Narrativa emergente ligada al combate</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="en-note">
          <em>EN:</em> 2.5D narrative beat 'em up where your fighting style impacts the recovery of human consciousness.
          Synchronize with A.N.A. across the zones of human knowledge.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="shot">
        <img src="/assets/ana/LTJtgi.png" alt="Screenshot de A.N.A. en combate" loading="lazy" />
        <p class="caption">Captura in-game · Iluminación neón y VFX del sistema</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GALLERY -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2><span class="prompt">&gt;&gt;</span> VISUAL LOG</h2>
      <div class="gallery">
        <img src="/assets/ana/J4kBC+.png" alt="Arte promocional A.N.A." loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/assets/ana/8IPPLh.png" alt="Pixel art / detalle" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/assets/ana/Xk_5qt.png" alt="Logo alternativo" loading="lazy" class="contain" />
        <img src="/assets/ana/dF6c7C.png" alt="Dark Void Studio" loading="lazy" class="contain" />
      </div>
      <div class="links-row">
        <a class="link-card" href="https://darkvvoidstudios.itch.io/ana" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <strong>itch.io — Descargar</strong>
          <span>darkvvoidstudios.itch.io/ana</span>
        </a>
        <a class="link-card" href="https://discord.gg/3nMe29jHzn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <strong>Discord Node</strong>
          <span>Únite al servidor</span>
        </a>
        <a class="link-card" href="https://www.instagram.com/darkvoidgames/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <strong>Instagram</strong>
          <span>@darkvoidgames · @a.n.a._thebrokenlink</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TEAM -->
  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2><span class="prompt">&gt;&gt;</span> EQUIPO DE DESARROLLO</h2>
      <p class="team-intro">
        Nacido de una game jam, hoy <strong>Dark Void Studio</strong> continúa el desarrollo de A.N.A. Agradecemos a
        <strong>Filo Games</strong> por su participación invaluable en la jam — su trabajo permanece en esta build.
      </p>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="member"><strong>Luis Mercado</strong><span>Dirección General, Producción</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Camila Silva</strong><span>Dirección Narrativa, Arte UI/UX & HUD</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Enier</strong><span>Dirección Artística, Animación, Level Design, VFX</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Álvaro Racchumi / SuperGamer15</strong><span>Dirección de Software, UI</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Giorgio.Ilustra2023</strong><span>Arte 2D</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Luis Fernandez / Chuma</strong><span>Lead QA</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Ralph Dudley Maura / SharpWalker14</strong><span>Programación UX</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>PeryLoth</strong><span>Mecánicas, Personajes y Enemigos</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Dáigoro Ventura</strong><span>SFX & Composición</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Cristian Lavado</strong><span>Composición Musical</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Dec</strong><span>Arte de Personaje & Fondos</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Kike Portal</strong><span>Diseño de Logo</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Elaias</strong><span>Arte 3D</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>Luisa Zarama</strong><span>Audio Design</span></div>
        <div class="member"><strong>QueenWarrior</strong><span>Game Design, Producción & Narrativa</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="announcement">
        <strong>ANUNCIO:</strong> Filo Games ya no forma parte del proyecto. A partir de ahora, <strong>Dark Void</strong> es el estudio que seguirá mejorando A.N.A. ¡Gracias por el apoyo!
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div>
        <strong>DARK VOID STUDIO © 2026</strong>
        <span>2.5D · Beat 'em up narrativo · Windows · In development</span>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="https://darkvvoidstudios.itch.io/">itch.io studio</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Dark-Void-Studio">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <style>
    .nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      background: rgba(15,3,16,0.75);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.5);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 20px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .brand {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
      font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    }
    .brand span { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 600; }
    .brand-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--cyan); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 18px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    .nav-links a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--cyan); border-color: var(--cyan); }

    .hero { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 20px 20px; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--cyan); margin: 0 0 12px; opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .blink { animation: blink 1.2s steps(1) infinite; }
    @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
    .title { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; line-height: 0.9; margin: 0; }
    .title .gradient {
      display: block; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 4.6rem); font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan) 0%, var(--violet) 45%, var(--magenta) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(0,179,255,0.35));
    }
    .subtitle {
      display: block; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--text); margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .tagline { color: var(--cyan-2); font-weight: 700; margin: 14px 0 10px; }
    .desc { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }
    .desc strong { color: var(--text); }
    .ctas { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin: 22px 0 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: all .18s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .btn.primary {
      background: var(--cyan); color: #000; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,179,255,0.6), 0 6px 20px rgba(0,179,255,0.35);
    }
    .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--cyan-2); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,179,255,0.45); }
    .btn.ghost { border-color: var(--border); color: var(--cyan); background: rgba(64,26,64,0.35); }
    .btn.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--cyan); color: var(--text); background: rgba(0,179,255,0.12); }
    .meta { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }
    .pill {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(64,26,64,0.7);
      border: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.9); color: var(--muted);
    }
    .updated { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; color: #6b8da0; margin: 10px 0 0; }

    .hero-visual { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .logo-card {
      position: relative; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #401a40 0%, #1e0a1e 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,179,255,0.08) inset;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .logo-card img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 10px; }
    .scanline {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 16px; pointer-events: none;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0 2px, rgba(0,179,255,0.04) 2px 3px);
      mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    }
    .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 10px; }
    .stat {
      background: rgba(41,3,41,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.6); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px; text-align: center; backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }
    .stat strong { display: block; font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--cyan); }
    .stat span { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--muted); }

    .section { padding: 46px 20px; }
    .section.alt { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(64,26,64,0.22) 0%, transparent 100%); border-top: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.25); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.25); }
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-head h2, .container > h2, .split h2 { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .prompt { color: var(--cyan); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
    .section-head p, .team-intro { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 22px; }

    .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .card {
      background: rgba(41,3,41,0.55); border: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.7); border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      transition: transform .18s, border-color .18s, box-shadow .18s;
    }
    .card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: rgba(0,179,255,0.6); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,179,255,0.12); }
    .card-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(0,179,255,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(0,179,255,0.3); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text); }
    .card p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .card-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--cyan); border: 1px dashed rgba(0,179,255,0.4); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px; }

    .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr; gap: 28px; align-items: start; }
    .lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }
    .split p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
    .checklist { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 14px 0; }
    .checklist li { padding: 6px 0 6px 22px; position: relative; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .checklist li::before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--cyan); }
    .en-note { font-size: 0.82rem; opacity: 0.85; border-left: 2px solid var(--border); padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
    .shot { background: #1a0a1a; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px; }
    .shot img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 10px; }
    .caption { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #6b8da0; text-align: center; margin: 8px 0 2px; }

    .gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.7fr 0.7fr 0.7fr; gap: 12px; }
    .gallery img {
      width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.6); background: #1a0a1a;
    }
    .gallery img.contain { object-fit: contain; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a0f2a, #1a0a1a); }
    .links-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .link-card {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 14px 16px;
      background: rgba(41,3,41,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.7); border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none; transition: border-color .18s, background .18s;
    }
    .link-card:hover { border-color: var(--cyan); background: rgba(0,179,255,0.08); }
    .link-card strong { color: var(--text); font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .link-card span { color: var(--muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; }

    .team-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
    .member {
      background: rgba(15,3,16,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.5); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px; line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .member strong { display: block; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .member span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.76rem; }
    .announcement {
      margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,46,154,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,46,154,0.25);
      color: #ffb3d6; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(101,18,101,0.35); padding: 18px 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .footer-inner strong { color: var(--text); letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-right: 10px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 14px; }
    .footer-links a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--cyan); }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid, .split, .cards, .gallery, .team-grid, .links-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .gallery img { height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16/10; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
